HP_IMG = ("Use the attached reference snaps as the style template: match their exact image quality, colours, framing and the look of the caption bar. A screenshot of a Snapchat snap from 2015, a real photo taken on an old iPhone 5 by a teenage student who raised the phone for one second. "
"The photo is out of focus and blurry: missed focus, motion blur, heavy sensor noise, strong JPEG compression with blocky artefacts, dull muted colours {cast}, "
"lifted milky blacks, no sharp details anywhere. Careless handheld framing, tilted, people cut off at the edges. Setting looks like the real film sets of a gothic "
"wizarding boarding school, students in black robes with white shirts, grey jumpers and striped house ties. {scene} Across the screen, slightly below the middle, "
"a Snapchat caption bar: a semi-transparent black rectangle at 60 percent opacity spanning the full width, with one line of small white Helvetica lowercase text, "
"centred, perfectly sharp, reading exactly: {caption}. Only the caption bar is sharp, the whole photo behind it is blurry. No other interface, no watermark, "
"no visible phone, no hands of mine in frame. Vertical 9:16, full-bleed.")
